  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Supply Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Guyana intends to increase the availability and accessibility to treated water for several communities in Guyana. Accordingly, the project will see the construction of 5 water treatment plants and associated works for 5 communities, spanning 4 Regions including; Region 2 &#x2013; Walton Hall to Charity, Region 3 &#x2013; Wakenaam and Leguan Island, Region 5 &#x2013; Bush Lot, and Region 6 &#x2013; Tain to No. 50 Village.</narrative>
  </description>
